      "description": "Central College - Student Library Assistant In order to use this site, it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser . All Jobs > Student Library Assistant Central College Apply Student Library Assistant PELLA, IA • Library Apply Job Type Part-time Description Assist in cataloging, acquisitions, and periodicals duties Assist in checking in and processing daily mail Shelve and shift books, current periodicals, journals and newspapers Straighten, shelf read and look for lost or missing items or data Check library catalog for requested items Enter short item records into library on-line system Check new materials against invoices Process new library materials and assist in maintaining current collections Pull books for call number changes Type new spine labels Requirements Attention to detail and ability to follow detailed processes Customer service skills Ability to work well with a team Complete accurate work Strong communication skills Computer skills Apply View All Jobs Powered by Paylocity Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Central College: Privacy Policy SMS Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy"
