      "description": "Central College - Student Fred's In order to use this site, it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser . All Jobs > Student Fred's Central College Apply Student Fred's PELLA, IA Apply Job Type Part-time Description Fred’s is a campus dining location offering grab-and-go items, snacks, smoothies, and quick meals. We are seeking friendly, dependable student employees who enjoy working in a fast-paced environment. No prior experience is required — training will be provided. Duties include: Operate the cash register (cash, credit, and Central ID transactions) Prepare basic food and beverage items Restock snacks, drinks, and supplies Clean work areas, equipment, and surfaces Follow all safety and sanitation guidelines Maintain a clean, organized workspace Requirements Must be a current Central College student Must complete required Human Resources paperwork prior to employment Reliable and able to work independently and as part of a team Strong multitasking skills in a fast-paced environment Apply View All Jobs Powered by Paylocity Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Central College: Privacy Policy SMS Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy"
